msgid "Cartoon effect"
msgstr "Debuxo"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/cartoon.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Level of trip** - Changes the intensity of the effect. The lower the "
"number, the coarser the edge detect is."
msgstr ""

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/cartoon.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Difference space** - Changes the intensity of the effect. The higher the "
"number, the thicker the edge will be drawn."
msgstr ""

